  "description": "Craving something warm yet cooling, roasted but fresh? Then look no further. We have whipped up a Mumbai-spiced roast potato salad, with pan-fried honey haloumi and a fresh tomato salad to keep it light and bright! We’ve replaced the baby capsicum in this recipe with snacking tomatoes due to local ingredient availability. It’ll be just as delicious, just follow your recipe card! This recipe is under 650kcal per serving and under 40g carbohydrates per serving.",
