  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with Mumbai spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbfe0de871cb9745535586-12722ea4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, to a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbfe0de871cb9745535586-61332757.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the haloumi is soaking, roughly chop tomato. Thinly slice cucumber. Pick mint leaves and finely chop. Finely chop garlic In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and garlic over medium-high heat, until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbfe0de871cb9745535586-65b6f215.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is cooling, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat, add the honey and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbfe0de871cb9745535586-d4d8b70a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mint, a good drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• To the dressing, add cucumber, tomato, mixed salad leaves and roasted potatoes. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbfe0de871cb9745535586-a59763de.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mumbai potato salad between bowls.\n• Top with honey haloumi. Drizzle over yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbfe0de871cb9745535586-f2fe8687.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
